{"2546530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Incremental", "steam_appid": 2546530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short incremental game about killing enemies, mining ores and unlocking powerups</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== KILL===</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void doesn't just hand you resources; you have to take them by force. Annihilate endless swarms of void creatures and harvest their dropped cash and ores right in the heat of battle. The deeper you go, the richer you get—if you can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/9fc94c0fa25abe3b05cb51ea6cfeeba8.poster.avif?t=1785183782\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/9fc94c0fa25abe3b05cb51ea6cfeeba8.webm?t=1785183782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/9fc94c0fa25abe3b05cb51ea6cfeeba8.mp4?t=1785183782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== UPGRADE ===</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is just part of the grind. Take your harvested wealth back to the massive  skill tree. Unlock devastating new Upgrades and abilities, increase your gathering multipliers, and permanently boost your stats to ensure your next run is even more profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/a80d6d322bc3c7d9e0e6e2c565d1a103.poster.avif?t=1785183782\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/a80d6d322bc3c7d9e0e6e2c565d1a103.webm?t=1785183782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/a80d6d322bc3c7d9e0e6e2c565d1a103.mp4?t=1785183782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== ENJOY THE CHAOS ===</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become more powerful to beat harder enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/a669bb72ebc9ffb2a57a06e7c551dc24.poster.avif?t=1785183782\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/a669bb72ebc9ffb2a57a06e7c551dc24.webm?t=1785183782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546530/extras/a669bb72ebc9ffb2a57a06e7c551dc24.mp4?t=1785183782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine ores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive skill tree (250+ upgrades)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast runs (under 30 seconds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Different areas (Levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 + Enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay ( 3 hours of playtime)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyable post game content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p cl